# Copy the addon

After any change under `AuctionPrices/`, copy it into the game client before finishing. Do not ask the user to copy it.

Run from the repository root:

```bash
npm run copy
```

That runs `scripts/copy-to-wow.js`, which reads `wow-path.local` and rsyncs `AuctionPrices/` into the client's `Interface/AddOns/AuctionPrices/`.

If the copy fails, say why and stop. The user still reloads the UI in game with `/reload`.
